/*
 * Emitter.h.ct - the C emitter's entry and binding layer (v1-PH-2 S8 tail).
 *
 * After the D4-D6 and shell moves this unit only owns the program entry
 * (`emit_program`), the single-unit entry (`emit_unit`), the error helpers and
 * the `ct_emit_*` bindings the driver calls. The writers themselves live in
 * `EmitHeader` (header / map / ABI), `EmitDecl` (declarations and concrete
 * impls), `EmitExpr` (the body writer and kind slices) and `EmitShell` (the
 * per-unit `.c` / `.h` shell and instance / ADT / Box glue).
 *
 * Macros do not cross a unit boundary, so every emit unit carries its own
 * mirrors of the node kinds and caps; MAX_TEXT 160 and MAX_PARAMS 16 are the
 * values `frontend/sym/Symbols.h.ct` lists. The instance is private to this
 * unit (`g_emit`); a generated header carries no #include, so neither the
 * FILE * nor the trait may appear in its surface. The driver reaches it
 * through the `pub` primitives at the end of the file.
 */
#include "Emitter.shim.h"
import frontend::sym::SymbolsTypeText;

